                                    "Rules redirecting traffic to HTTPS Similarly, any HTTP redirect to HTTPS at the origin while the Cloudflare proxy is enabled will result in users being unable to visit your site without a valid certificate at Cloudflare's edge. If you do not have a valid custom or advanced certificate at Cloudflare's edge and are unsure "
